flowchart TD
    START["☀️ 25 Jun — SKELETON in 1–2 weeks · Events transplant: STEP 1 (cull) DONE ✅ · STEP 2 (shopping→shoppingView) CODE + unit-fix DONE, node-check PASS, staged — awaiting FINAL local re-test + push · Tina testing + FMF pics"]

    %% ============ EVENTS TRANSPLANT ============
    START --> NOW["▶️ EVENTS ORGAN TRANSPLANT — buffet plan+shopping are BESPOKE, not on the shared engine"]
    NOW --> ANAT["🫀 ANATOMY (live audit 24–25 Jun): plannerSummary in events.js = DEAD code (culled, Step 1).<br/>LIVE buffet = buffet.js. buffetStep7 = the bespoke My-Plan+Shopping page (~270–839):<br/>own scaling brain (computeQuantity/extractScaled/practicalIngredient), own itemMap +<br/>shopCategory ×7 → GOLD single-cost list, no green box, no two-cost split. buffetStep8 = Sauces."]
    ANAT --> TBUF["BUFFET TRANSPLANT — 3 staged steps, each node-check + LOCAL test (open index.html, no deploy), batch ONE push:"]
    TBUF --> T1["✅ STEP 1 DONE (staged, not pushed — batch w/ photos): dead plannerSummary culled<br/>from events.js. grep=0 · node-check PASS · 2067→2026 (−41) · core.js untouched ·<br/>backup %TEMP%\\events.js.precull.bak."]
    T1 --> T2["✅ STEP 2 CODE DONE (node-check PASS, 1128→1092, −36) — SHOPPING → shared shoppingView.<br/>shoppingView fed by buildPlanData now renders buffet's list: two-cost green-food/gold-shop split<br/>+ green box + 🧂 pantry split + aisle sort + Pro-lock, all from the shared engine. STAGED, not pushed.<br/>NEXT: local test (open index.html) → batch push w/ Step-1 events.js + photos."]
    T2 --> T2A["T2a ADAPTER (built): buffetDishes(allPortioned,g) + parseAmt() inside buffetStep7. Reuses<br/>buffet's own quantity brain (improveIngredientName→practicalIngredient→computeQuantity) to scale<br/>to g guests, then parses the display string back to numeric {amt,unit} for buildPlanData.<br/>parseAmt unit-tested on 17 strings (incl '3 × 400g tins'→1200g, punnets, '~340g', counts→pcs)."]
    T2A --> T2B["T2b SEAM done in buffetStep7 — CULLED: itemMap loop, manual salt&pepper, shopCategory()+7 calls,<br/>bespoke gold wrapper, !isPro lock, old whatsappMsg. KEPT: allPortioned, section() plan rows (Step 3), g.<br/>ADDED: global window.buffetToggleShop(name); checked flipped key-based → NAME-based.<br/>⚠️ EYEBALL ON LOCAL TEST: plan-summary green (eventsData r.costPP) vs shopping cook-total<br/>(PRICE_DB) may differ slightly — expected, reconciles in Step 3 when planView takes over. Also:<br/>per-item 'which dish' sublabel + Reset-all gone (shared-engine look); per-item gold price now shows."]
    T2B --> T2C["🐛→✅ UNIT-FIX (Claude Code, 25 Jun, +3 lines parseAmt only): live test showed Cucumber<br/>'80g per person'@20 → '2g', Whole chickens '6g', totals INVERTED (green food R1,126 > gold spend R843).<br/>ROOT CAUSE: parseAmt returned {1.6,'kg'} but the shared engine reads amt as BASE UNIT (g/ml) —<br/>buildPlanData pack/display path treats kg-number as grams → 1.6kg shown as 2g; green used kg-aware<br/>lineCook (right) while gold used grams path (tiny) → inversion. FIX: normalise kg→g, L→ml (×1000) in<br/>parseAmt to match Braai's grams convention. node-check PASS · Step-1 cull intact · only buffet.js ·<br/>backup %TEMP%\\buffet.js.preunit.bak. buffetDishes() unchanged. NOT pushed."]
    T2C --> T3["③ STEP 3 PLAN → shared planView + FIX starters wiring → My Plan identical to every<br/>section, starters finally register. (section() plan rows replaced here.)"]
    T3 --> T4["THEN roll the same 3 steps to the other 4 Events features:<br/>Finger Foods · Cakes · Kiddies · Beverages. THEN Spice → opener → page compare."]
    NOW --> NRULE["⚠️ ONE STEP AT A TIME, verified live each time. Recipe DETAIL already correct (shared, green) — it's only plan+shopping that's bespoke."]

    %% ============ EVENTS BUGS (found 25 Jun local test) ============
    START --> EBUG["🐞 EVENTS BUGS — found in 25 Jun buffet local test"]
    EBUG --> EB1["✅ SAUCE DISPATCH FIXED (Claude Code, 25 Jun): added `if(bs===8) return buffetStep8();`<br/>above the `return buffetStep1();` fallback in staged events.js (~line 1107). node-check PASS, staged.<br/>Sauces tile now opens buffetStep8 instead of bouncing to the planner. Batch with the push."]
    EBUG --> EB2["SAUCES-NOT-IN-PLAN (OPEN, Events-sameness work): selected sauces live in eventSelectedSauces,<br/>but buffetStep7 gathers only starters+mains+sides+salads+desserts → sauces never reach the plan<br/>or shopping even once they open. Also a duplicate sauce list in buffetStep3 (Mains) toggles into<br/>eventSelectedMains (legacy/dead). Fold into Events-sameness + 'cull dead Events code'. NOT this pass."]

    %% ============ TOOLING / PREVENTION ============
    START --> TOOL["🛠️ PHOTO-AUDIT TOOL (built 25 Jun) — tools/photo-audit.js · run: node tools/photo-audit.js from repo root"]
    TOOL --> TL1["v2 (25 Jun): GATE = node Tools/photo-audit.js → only genuine breakage: ❌ broken photoName ·<br/>🔤 wrong case (photo exists but won't load; 404s on GitHub which is case-sensitive). Exits 1 if any.<br/>Inherently noise-free — themes/drinks can't land in these buckets. THIS is the pre-push gate."]
    TL1 --> TL2["v2 SHOOT-LIST (opt-in, informational): node Tools/photo-audit.js --missing lists ⚠️ recipes with<br/>no photo yet (emoji fallback covers these — NOT a bug). Scope to one section: --missing spice.js etc.<br/>Kept OUT of the gate on purpose (the all-recipes 996 count was launch-planning noise, not breakage).<br/>NEW WORKFLOW RULE: run the bare gate before every push; use --missing &lt;section&gt; when planning a shoot."]

